{"id":"034ceadbaaf08241","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-parallel-moves.md","title":"平行移动引理","display":"lem-parallel-moves — 平行移动引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-parallel-moves","aliases":["56-lem-parallel-moves"],"display":"lem-parallel-moves — 平行移动引理","depends_on":["[[56-df-orthogonal]]","[[56-df-parallel-rewrite]]","[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","[[56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition]]"],"source_section":"§4.3 Lemma 4.3.3; §4.7 Lemma 4.7.9","source_printed_pages":"101,123","source_ocr_blocks":[122,144],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-parallel-moves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-parallel-moves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-parallel-moves — 平行移动引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cdd1f74aa0c940f7\" href=\"?note=cdd1f74aa0c940f7\" title=\"56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition\">56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.3 Lemma 4.3.3; §4.7 Lemma 4.7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"101,123"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>122</span><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^*\">\\(\\to_R^*\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow_R\">\\(\\Rightarrow_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1f468692d9334725\" href=\"?note=1f468692d9334725\" title=\"56-df-parallel-rewrite\">56-df-parallel-rewrite</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,w\\in T\">\\(s,t,w\\in T\\)</span>；单步与平行步的投影结论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cdd1f74aa0c940f7\" href=\"?note=cdd1f74aa0c940f7\" title=\"56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition\">56-lem-parallel-moves-proposition</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\to_R^*t\\land s\\Rightarrow_R w)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in T\\;(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\land w\\to_R^*v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\to_R^*t\\land s\\Rightarrow_R w)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in T\\;(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\land w\\to_R^*v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s\\to_R^*t\\land s\\to_R w)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in T\\;(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\land w\\to_R^*v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s\\to_R^*t\\land s\\to_R w)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists v\\in T\\;(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\land w\\to_R^*v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式对给定有限归约 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=s_0\\to_R\\cdots\\to_R s_n=t\">\\(s=s_0\\to_R\\cdots\\to_R s_n=t\\)</span> 的长度归纳。零步取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v=w\">\\(v=w\\)</span>。若末步前的归纳结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{n-1}\\Rightarrow_R u\">\\(s_{n-1}\\Rightarrow_R u\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\to_R^*u\">\\(w\\to_R^*u\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{n-1}\\to_R t\">\\(s_{n-1}\\to_R t\\)</span> 与该平行步用平行移动命题，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Rightarrow_R v\">\\(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\to_R^*v\">\\(u\\to_R^*v\\)</span>；传递性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\to_R^*v\">\\(w\\to_R^*v\\)</span>。第二式来自单步是平行步的特例：单个合法位置作为平行见证。</p>\n<p>这里显式保留较强的“初始平行步”版本。由于有限个初始不交 redex 的残余仍两两不交，可以把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\Rightarrow_R v\">\\(t\\Rightarrow_R v\\)</span> 具体实现为收缩它们的残余；本原子本身只断言项端点，不把没有保存位置/规则见证的关系边当作具体收缩步。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Lemmas 4.3.3、4.7.9；已读并重建原书对有限路径长度的归纳，归纳的核心 PMP 已在本目录独立展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]